  <summary date="2026-09-28T15:50:47Z" status="Introduced in House">Prison Staffing Reform Act of 2025

This bill requires the Bureau of Prisons (BOP) to (1) complete (through an external entity) a comprehensive review of staffing across the BOP, and (2) implement a plan for filling vacancies.</summary>
